  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>歡迎來到銅獄——一座專為囚禁最狡猾的逃脫專家而設計的地下要塞。探索狹窄的走廊、少數牢房、幽閉恐懼的通風管道，以及更多內容。逃離由強化銅、凝灰岩和鐵打造的牢籠吧！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>特色介紹</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">蜿蜒曲折、燈光昏暗的<strong>通風管道</strong>，恰好能讓人匍匐前進</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">擁擠的<strong>牢房區</strong>，配有閃爍的燈光與機械鎖</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">隱藏開關、紅石陷阱與紅石謎題</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">鏽跡斑斑的維護隧道，非常適合<strong>秘密逃脫</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">你會遵守規則維持秩序，還是冒險一搏，嘗試不可能的逃脫？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>祝玩得愉快，願上帝保佑你 :)</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3cde78ee-771e-4439-aa40-863723139555.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"790\" height=\"518\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">支持我！</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"coff.ee/danielboonemc\" rel=\"nofollow\">coff.ee/danielboonemc</a></span><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也歡迎看看我的其他地圖！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七個生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/pale-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蒼白天空空島</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/boones-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">布恩的空島</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/deserts-and-mountains-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沙漠與山脈冒險地圖</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J.</strong></span></p>",
